{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1000_p", "source_sha256": "727e0ef2f467a1df0cc9ec0ffac44b159f1a4eb0e9b8791dfaa64aa5d6c0a7bd", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のパジャマ特集。\nエレナの撮影は順調に進み、そろそろ休憩の時間だ）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的睡衣特辑。艾蕾娜的拍摄进展顺利，差不多到了休息时间）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "d11034f4c020abde730a4eb2afe3a13c7c3a74c8bddbaee21c5d74e6ce525d7a", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}。\nワタシ、ちゃんと眠ってるように見えたカナ？", "zh": "呐呐，{$P$}。\n我看起来像是睡得很香吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1002_p", "source_sha256": "23276765b9e3132b7093732ec9e42b63794815c73dbf372cb7a0fbfee0477120", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだ！\nスタッフさんも「いい表情だった」って褒めてたよ。", "zh": "啊，非常好！\n工作人员也夸你“表情很棒”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "38f8504053f9c86b29cbf71eac711e8cd93d3780b4320e5c457aed5fed65cd9b", "ja": "よかった～。実は、パジャマのふわふわが気持ちよくて\nホントに眠っちゃいそうだったヨー。", "zh": "太好了～其实是因为睡衣的柔软触感太舒服了，真的差点就睡着了哟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "5fe185a252d19f2cf1ca5a80c6428d5d7037c189de8bb04afcd3bf05132ce80d", "ja": "あのまま眠ってたら、きっといい夢が見られたかもネ。\nもう一度見たかったあの夢とか……！", "zh": "要是就那么睡着的话，说不定能做一个好梦呢。\n比如之前还想再做一次的那个梦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1005_p", "source_sha256": "77b565ace9792707f16511a97b7c881eb65cdd25a9fd2514ae60a9be798ce234", "ja": "……あの夢？", "zh": "……那个梦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "c619686654cb1a449c326c8b50349538c935a6701b8d18622d5e0ed79977e28d", "ja": "うん！　いーっぱいサンバを踊る夢！　体がとっても\n軽くて、ず～っと踊っててもぜんぜん疲れないノ！", "zh": "嗯！梦见跳好多好多桑巴！身体特别轻盈，就算一直跳下去也完全不会累！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cc143fe46c3f944db3c4887ad54832eafd0824045bb2eb08bd2264162633efc4", "ja": "さすが夢の中だな。でもなんだか楽しそうだ。\nエレナがもう一度見たくなるのもわかる気がするよ。", "zh": "不愧是在梦里啊。不过感觉还挺开心的。\n我好像也能理解，为什么艾蕾娜还想再看一次了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "c220097155d99facb28aed7eee697edb7a901814db5e85c199491c446dba0fc0", "ja": "ノンノン！　夢には続きがあって……最初は\nワタシだけなんだけど、途中でパートナーが現れるノ。", "zh": "不不！梦还没结束呢……一开始只有我一个人，但中途会出现伙伴哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "9c71d1e17a1b9c5823e27688e428d6f514ed0bf0d5bd7ae2a3a5fd76e19aa6f3", "ja": "そのパートナーは……なんと！\n{$P$}だったんだヨ～♪", "zh": "那个伙伴……竟然是！{$P$}哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6e482b09bf25a4a6cddc786a3835d522ef95adede16552269d8e03d26dc7b7e9", "ja": "えっ！？　俺が、サンバを……？", "zh": "诶！？我来跳桑巴……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "185f20d7fb0d2d8d72c02c0faf41226bb14c2cfa1250a70b4d3c34d6cb6eded9", "ja": "激しいリズムもちゃんと乗って、パワフルなダンスを\nしてたヨ！　とっても上手でビックリしちゃった！", "zh": "连激烈的节奏也完全跟上了，跳出了活力十足的舞蹈！跳得特别棒，真让我大吃一惊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1012_p", "source_sha256": "905d621223fefda9af9d284f619c387c7285ebf085cdda3735f6ca3c843b4c69", "ja": "あははっ……。\n夢だから何でもありってことなのかな……？", "zh": "啊哈哈……。\n因为是梦，所以什么都可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "aeaf6b8503ed044768bee7b33805acbaba0df6fd08934d4ac41dd5c91f6dc0c2", "ja": "そうカモ？　あの姿を見せられないのが残念だヨ……。\nすっごくカッコよかったんだから！", "zh": "也许吧？真可惜，没法让你看看那副模样……  \n那可真是帅呆了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fde781225f16a2fe1b960f9b4c0a6b7ff223997e5bffa8642b7d911428e699e8", "ja": "そ、そうか……。今の話を聞いて、もしかしたら今夜\nサンバを踊る夢を見るかもしれないな。……多分。", "zh": "哦、这样啊……听你这么一说，说不定今晚会梦见跳桑巴呢。……大概吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "c23143d1faf12f19b3821c616eedbd86db71b51be1273a3049dce03f7a81be74", "ja": "ワオ！　それならワタシ、\n{$P$}の夢に出てあげる！", "zh": "哇！那样的话，我就出现在{$P$}的梦里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0463_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "548ac5ff200443241e8236e8b8a99e854368091cdbc3c1b94df19cd801f05102", "ja": "夢でも会えるなんて、うれしいナー。\nい～っぱいダンスしようネ♪　エヘヘ。", "zh": "在梦里也能见到，好开心呀——\n我们一起跳好多好多舞吧♪ 嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
